<a class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline-variant hover:text-primary underline decoration-primary underline-offset-4" href="#">Chính sách bảo mật</a>
<a class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline-variant hover:text-primary underline decoration-primary underline-offset-4" href="#">Liên hệ</a>
</div>
